<topic template="Default" modified="2025-04-01T16:41:07.388-04:00" lasteditedby="rbwinst" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="../helpproject.xsd" status="Under Construction">
  <title translate="true">SSM: GWT Source and Sink Mixing Package Pane</title>
  <body>
    <header>
      <para styleclass="Heading1"><text styleclass="Heading1" translate="true">SSM: GWT/GWE Source and Sink Mixing Package Pane</text></para>
    </header>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><text styleclass="Normal" translate="true">The </text><text styleclass="Strong" translate="true">SSM: GWT Source and Sink Mixing Package </text><text styleclass="Normal" translate="true">and</text><text styleclass="Strong" translate="true"> SSM: GWE Source and Sink Mixing Package</text><text styleclass="Normal" translate="true"> panes are used to activate the </text><text styleclass="Strong" translate="true">Source and Sink Mixing</text><text styleclass="Normal" translate="true"> package in GWT and GWE models respectively. It is on the </text><link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="MODFLOW_Packages_Dialog_Box" styleclass="Strong" translate="true">MODFLOW Packages and Programs</link><text styleclass="Normal" translate="true"> dialog box under </text><link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="Groundwater-Transport" styleclass="Strong" translate="true">Groundwater Transport|</link><text styleclass="Normal" translate="true"> | </text><link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="GWT-Groundwater-Transport" styleclass="Strong" translate="true">GWT: Groundwater Transport</link><text styleclass="Strong" translate="true"> </text><text styleclass="Normal" translate="true">and under</text><text styleclass="Strong" translate="true"> </text><link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="Groundwater-Transport" styleclass="Strong" translate="true">Groundwater Transport|</link><text styleclass="Normal" translate="true"> |</text><link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="GWE-Groundwater-Energy-Transpo" styleclass="Strong" translate="true">GWE: Groundwater Energy Transport</link><text styleclass="Normal" translate="true">. The </text><text styleclass="Strong" translate="true">Source and Sink Mixing</text><text styleclass="Normal" translate="true"> package is required if any boundary packages are used in the flow model and is prohibited if no boundary packages are used in the flow model.</text></para>
  </body>
